  "final_text": "I fixed the bug in `build_format_selector` in `youtube_dl/YoutubeDL.py`. `test_youtube_format_selection` now passes, and so do the other 13 tests in `test/test_YoutubeDL.py`.\n\nThe format-spec parser crashed on a spec like `bestvideo/best,bestaudio`. After parsing the `/` choice it appended the choice to the list and reset the current selector to `None`. The `,` that followed then appended that `None` as well, and building the selector function hit `None.type`.\n\nThe `/` branch now keeps the choice as the current selector instead of appending it, so the `,` appends it once."
